Coordinated redesign following on TODO 4:
- =parPermanence= becomes a Python list (breaking change; only one
  caller in tree).
- =templates= tagged =["userConfig", "cwdConfig"]=; =activity= tagged
  =["cwdConfig"]=.
- Eliminate the =root= param entirely from =initiate= / =initiateSub=;
  both always operate on cwd.
- =activity= becomes optional on both commands, resolved by new
  =_resolveActivity()= (CLI → cwdConfig).
- =initiate= / =initiateSub= auto-persist =activity= to cwdConfig on
  success (deferred until after preconditions pass).
- Examples menu grows a conditional chapter: if cwdConfig has
  =activity= set, show a bare =aiActivity.cs -i initiate= line
  at the top of the =initiate= chapter.
- Update =verify.sh= to drop =--root= and add coverage for
