- top-top-layer  /bx-initiate
- top-layer  Start with /bx-confirm0  or /bx-confirm-here
- mid-layer1: Perhaps  /bx-import-archived
- mid-layer2: Work on selected AI-Workplan.org
- mid-layer3: Perhaps git stage your work and then /bx-ai-outputs for its commit message
