* DONE [#A] <<16.1>> Decide on the right name for the CS-Cmnd -- aiInTokens
CLOSED: [2026-10-07 Wed] SCHEDULED:<2026-10-07 Wed 18:07>
:PROPERTIES:
:ARCHIVE_TIME: 2026-10-09 Fri 00:53
:ARCHIVE_FILE: /bxRepos/bisos-pip/aiActivity/AI-WorkPlan.org
